    },
    {
      "start": 78.16,
      "end": 83.74,
      "text": "not refusal just delay like i'm faced a step away"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.24,
      "end": 89.66,
      "text": "i can see it i can feel but it never turns to real"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.22,
      "end": 102.06,
      "text": "conversations start to slow grades arrive but never flow"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.88,
      "end": 107.96,
      "text": "by the time i try to speak they've already grown too weak"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.8,
      "end": 113.92,
      "text": "every action held in place by an unseen kind of brace"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.56,
      "end": 119.66,
      "text": "future self is always late car behind the shifting gate"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.66,
      "end": 123.7,
      "text": "i'm not still i'm displaced"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.66,
      "end": 127.9,
      "text": "clocks don't break they just bend"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.9,
      "end": 130.78,
      "text": "when the start won't descend"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.78,
      "end": 136.52,
      "text": "i defer into the stretch where intention never sets"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.52,
      "end": 142.6,
      "text": "every motion half alive never fully arrives"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.6,
      "end": 148.3,
      "text": "not avoidance just a slide through a widening insight"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.3,
      "end": 154.02,
      "text": "i'm adjacent to the flow but i never fully go"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.34,
      "end": 166.9,
      "text": "it's not that i won't move it's that the moment moves first"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.82,
      "end": 174.36,
      "text": "and i follow after what if delay isn't absence but distance"
    },
    {
      "start": 174.36,
      "end": 183.86,
      "text": "what if now is elastic and i miss a line"
    },
    {
      "start": 206.62,
      "end": 211.72,
      "text": "i can feel the tension ease when i stop dividing me"
    },
    {
      "start": 212.46,
      "end": 217.9,
      "text": "let the seconds fall as one instead of something to outrun"
    },
    {
      "start": 218.68,
      "end": 223.94,
      "text": "there's no future i must chase just a shift in how i place"
    },
    {
      "start": 224.52,
      "end": 229.82,
      "text": "where i stand inside the drift not resisting what won't fix"
    },
    {
      "start": 230.62,
      "end": 235.02,
      "text": "not behind not ahead"
    },
    {
      "start": 236.46,
      "end": 241.94,
      "text": "i release into the frame where the moment stays the same"
    },
    {
      "start": 241.94,
      "end": 247.78,
      "text": "not extended not confined just a steadier kind of time"
    },
    {
      "start": 247.78,
      "end": 253.58,
      "text": "i don't force it into place i just meet it where it stays"
    },
    {
      "start": 253.58,
